 #: src/filters/artistic/weave.xml:171(title)
 msgid "Adding a lattice using <quote>Weave</quote> texture"
-msgstr ""
+msgstr "Lägg till ett galler med texturen <quote>Väv</quote>"
 
 #: src/filters/artistic/weave.xml:178(para)
 msgid ""
 "Narrower the ribbon width, wider the ribbon spacing, and filled with the "
 "<quote>Wood&nbsp;#1</quote> pattern."
 msgstr ""
+"Smalare band, större avstånd mellan banden och mönstret "
+"<quote>Trä&nbsp;#1</quote>."
 
 #: src/filters/artistic/weave.xml:185(para)
 msgid ""
 "This texture can be a lattice that you can see the original image through "
 "its mesh holes. Add a new, transparent layer over the active layer for the "
-"lattice, and apply this filter. Select a black regular square in the texture "
-"layer using the <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-by-color-select\">Select By Color</"
-"link> tool, then delete black squares in selection on the texture layer to "
-"be chink holes. Reverse the selection, and activate the transparent layer so "
-"that you can fill the lattice surface with a pattern, then drag and drop "
-"your favorite pattern over the image window."
-msgstr ""
+"lattice, and apply this filter. Select a black regular square in the texture"
+" layer using the <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-by-color-select\">Select By "
+"Color</link> tool, then delete black squares in selection on the texture "
+"layer to be chink holes. Reverse the selection, and activate the transparent"
+" layer so that you can fill the lattice surface with a pattern, then drag "
+"and drop your favorite pattern over the image window."
+msgstr ""
+"Du kan använda texturen som ett galler och se originalbilden genom maskorna."
+" Skapa ett nytt, genomskinligt lager ovanför det aktiva lagret för gallret "
+"och använd det här filtret. Markera en svart ruta i texturlagret med "
+"verktyget <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-by-color-select\">Markera efter "
+"färg</link> och ta sedan bort de svarta rutorna i markeringen så att de blir"
+" hål i gallret. Invertera markeringen och aktivera det genomskinliga lagret "
+"så att du kan fylla gallrets yta med ett mönster. Dra sedan det mönster du "
+"vill använda till bildfönstret."
 
