 #: src/filters/artistic/cubism.xml:94(para)
 msgid ""
 "This variable determines the size, in pixels, of the squares to be used. "
 "This is, in effect, the size of the little squares of tissue paper used in "
 "generating the new image. The slider can be clicked, the exact pixel size "
-"can be entered into the slider, or the <guilabel>+</guilabel> and <guilabel>-"
-"</guilabel> buttons can be used."
+"can be entered into the slider, or the <guilabel>+</guilabel> and "
+"<guilabel>-</guilabel> buttons can be used."
 msgstr ""
+"Den här variabeln anger kvadraternas storlek i pixlar. Det motsvarar "
+"storleken på de små silkespappersbitar som den nya bilden skapas av. Du kan "
+"klicka på skjutreglaget, ange en exakt pixelstorlek i dess inmatningsfält "
+"eller använda knapparna <guilabel>+</guilabel> och <guilabel>−</guilabel>."
 
