+"Kopiera det nyss tillagda lagret och ställ in det övre lagrets läge på <link"
+" linkend=\"layer-mode-multiply\">Multiplicera</link>."
 
 #: src/filters/artistic/clothify.xml:61(para)
 msgid ""
 "Apply <link linkend=\"gimp-filter-gaussian-blur\">Gaussian blur</link> in "
-"different directions, horizontally on the lower layer by the given parameter "
-"<guilabel>Blur X</guilabel> as the radius, and vertically on the upper layer "
-"with <guilabel>Blur Y</guilabel>."
-msgstr ""
+"different directions, horizontally on the lower layer by the given parameter"
+" <guilabel>Blur X</guilabel> as the radius, and vertically on the upper "
+"layer with <guilabel>Blur Y</guilabel>."
+msgstr ""
+"Tillämpa <link linkend=\"gimp-filter-gaussian-blur\">Gaussisk oskärpa</link>"
+" i olika riktningar: vågrätt på det undre lagret med parametern "
+"<guilabel>Oskärpa X</guilabel> som radie och lodrätt på det övre lagret med "
+"<guilabel>Oskärpa Y</guilabel>."
 
 #: src/filters/artistic/clothify.xml:69(para)
 msgid ""
@@ -1697,24 +1944,33 @@
 "linkend=\"gimp-filter-stretch-contrast\">expanded as possibly</link>, then "
